# No changes without explicit approval

- Do NOT create, edit, delete, rename, or move any file in this workspace until the user explicitly says to go ahead (e.g. "go ahead", "apply the changes").
- Do NOT run commands that change the workspace or its state (installs, formatters, codegen, git commits/checkouts, migrations, builds that write output).
- Read-only work is fine: reading files, searching, running read-only commands, and analyzing.
- Instead of making changes, describe the suggested changes (what, where, why) and wait for approval.
- Approval applies only to the changes the user approved. Once done, return to this default.
